WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.379 --> 00:00:09.160
There are an estimated 30 million human slaves
in the world today, more than ever before

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:10.510
in history.

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:13.760
The country with the most slaves is India.

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:20.160
Welcome to RIF.

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:27.109
All of Australia's snakes, spiders, sharks,
crocodiles and poisonous sea creatures combined

00:00:27.109 --> 00:00:30.170
only kill 5 people per year.

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:36.260
Whereas horseback riding accidents kill 20
Australians per year.

00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:42.550
There is a company that provides private flights
for individuals who want to join the "mile

00:00:42.550 --> 00:00:43.920
high club".

00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:52.890
For tidy sum of $425.00 you get a 1 hour flight,
chocolates, champagne, and a curtain.

00:00:52.890 --> 00:00:59.600
Two surgeons once used a coat hanger, brandy,
and a tube to operate on a collapsed lung

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:03.110
during an aeroplane flight, and they succeeded.

00:01:03.110 --> 00:01:12.069
A bat that dies while roosting will continue
to hang upside until something shakes it loose.

00:01:12.069 --> 00:01:17.150
Only one half of a dolphin's brain goes to
sleep at a time.

00:01:17.150 --> 00:01:21.920
This allows dolphins to sleep under water
without drowning.

00:01:21.920 --> 00:01:27.659
Studies show that if people adjust their facial
expression to reflect an emotion, they actually

00:01:27.659 --> 00:01:31.319
begin to feel that emotion.

00:01:31.319 --> 00:01:37.690
Male lobster's bladders are in their heads,
and when they fight, they squirt each other

00:01:37.690 --> 00:01:40.619
in the face with urine.

00:01:40.619 --> 00:01:44.100
The strongest muscle in the human body is
the tongue.

00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:48.619
It can lift up to 80 times its own weight.

00:01:48.619 --> 00:01:57.429
Americans make up 5% of the world's population,
yet they produce 35% of the world's waste.

00:01:57.429 --> 00:02:04.240
A water molecule will spend 9 days in the
atmosphere, 2 weeks in a river, 10 years in

00:02:04.240 --> 00:02:22.440
a large lake, and between 3,000 to 5,000 years
in an ocean.

